    {
      "kind": "idiom",
      "subject": "חרון אפו",
      "rationale": "Sefoko sa Seheberu: 'go tuka ga nko ya gagwe' = bohale bjo bo feteletšego; bo fetotšwe go 'go tuka ga bohale'."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "A se ke lwa lona, bao ba fetago tsela ka moka: lebeletšang gomme le bone, ge e ba go na le botlhoko bjalo ka botlhoko bja ka, bjo bo dirilwego go nna, bjo Yahwe a bo ntshabeditšego ka letšatši la go tuka ga bohale bja gagwe.",
